  (1296, 'release_notes', 'release_notes', 'github', 'actor-priya', 'project-api', 'NoxFeed-Demo', 'activity-api', 84, '✅ activity-api #84 Shipped - Performance\nRepository: activity-api\nPull Request: #84 - Batch webhook deliveries by installation\nAuthor: priya-demo | Merged by: priya-demo\nBranch: perf/webhook-batches → main\n\nChange Summary\nType: Performance\nDetails: Webhook deliveries are grouped by installation while ordering and retry behavior remain stable.\nBreaking Changes: None identified\nAffected Areas: ingestion, queues, delivery metrics\n\nRecommendations\nWatch delivery latency and retry volume during the first production hour.', 75600, '{"action":"closed","pr_number":84,"pr":{"number":84,"title":"Batch webhook deliveries by installation","html_url":"https://github.com/github/docs/pull/39900","author":"priya-demo","head_ref":"perf/webhook-batches","base_ref":"main"}}'),
  (1295, 'release_notes', 'release_notes', 'github', 'actor-jordan', 'project-docs', 'NoxFeed-Demo', 'developer-docs', 20, '✅ developer-docs #20 Shipped - Documentation\nRepository: developer-docs\nPull Request: #20 - Restructure the installation guide\nAuthor: jordan-demo | Merged by: jordan-demo\nBranch: docs/install-flow → main\n\nChange Summary\nType: Documentation\nDetails: The setup guide now follows a staged organization rollout from permissions through validation.\nBreaking Changes: None identified\nAffected Areas: installation guide, administrator checklist\n\nRecommendations\nValidate every link from a signed-out browser.', 190800, '{"action":"closed","pr_number":20,"pr":{"number":20,"title":"Restructure the installation guide","html_url":"https://github.com/github/docs/pull/39700","author":"jordan-demo","head_ref":"docs/install-flow","base_ref":"main"}}'),
